            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Let&#x27;s be careful of the language here. We want an expression that is &quot;<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6]</span> larger&quot; than the one above, <strong>not</strong> &quot;<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6]</span> <em>times</em> larger.&quot; Therefore, we should <em>add</em> <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6,]</span> not multiply.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Let's be careful of the language here. We want an expression that is \"[MATH: 6] larger\" than the one above, not \"[MATH: 6] times larger.\" Therefore, we should add [MATH: 6,] not multiply.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, let&#x27;s add some brackets:</p>",
